01:09:44.440 --> 01:09:46.110
<i>that's exactly our problem.</i>


01:09:46.440 --> 01:09:50.480
<i>It's right in front of us,</i>
<i>black on white, with holes in it:</i>


01:09:50.650 --> 01:09:52.860
<i>We cannot be together.</i>


01:09:53.150 --> 01:09:54.690
<i>You know that as well as I do,</i>


01:09:54.860 --> 01:09:57.520
<i>you're just better</i>
<i>at fooling yourself.</i>


01:09:58.400 --> 01:10:00.310
<i>And I don't mean that in a bad way.</i>


01:10:00.480 --> 01:10:03.360
<i>Without you,</i>
<i>there would never have been an us.</i>


01:10:03.520 --> 01:10:06.520
<i>You found me,</i>
<i>and through you I found myself.</i>


01:10:06.980 --> 01:10:08.980
<i>It was like a dream.</i>


01:10:09.770 --> 01:10:12.270
<i>Remember our day at the lake?</i>


01:10:12.690 --> 01:10:16.310
<i>You filmed the entire trip,</i>
<i>right from the start, every detail.</i>


01:10:16.480 --> 01:10:17.900
<i>And I didn't want that.</i>


01:10:18.060 --> 01:10:20.110
<i>What if someone saw?</i>


01:10:20.440 --> 01:10:23.310
<i>But you didn't care,</i>
<i>'cause you're fearless.</i>


01:10:23.480 --> 01:10:25.860
<i>I want to be fearless, too.</i>


01:10:26.770 --> 01:10:30.810
<i>You once told me that you were</i>
<i>surprised that you're still alive.</i>


01:10:31.560 --> 01:10:34.400
<i>See, that's exactly how I feel.</i>


01:10:35.610 --> 01:10:38.480
<i>The water in the lake</i>
<i>was fucking cold, by the way.</i>


01:10:38.810 --> 01:10:41.480
<i>I don't remember if we</i>
<i>ever developed the reel.</i>


01:10:41.650 --> 01:10:43.730
<i>Is it still in the camera?"</i>


01:11:14.610 --> 01:11:17.860
Get out of the way.
Let me through.


01:11:20.650 --> 01:11:23.020
Get back to work!


01:11:24.150 --> 01:11:26.520
<i>Roll him over.</i>
<i>On the other side.</i>


01:11:27.110 --> 01:11:28.940
<i>The other side.</i>


01:11:29.980 --> 01:11:31.520
<i>He's not breathing.</i>


01:11:37.610 --> 01:11:39.020
Hoffmann.


01:11:43.560 --> 01:11:45.440
Get out.


01:12:56.020 --> 01:12:57.610
Where is he?


01:13:02.060 --> 01:13:06.060
Where's Oskar?
-He's not here anymore. He's gone.


01:13:07.020 --> 01:13:09.520
What? Where did they take him?


01:13:09.690 --> 01:13:13.610
They didn't take him anywhere.
He left through the side door.


01:13:14.980 --> 01:13:17.190
He jumped off the roof yesterday.


01:13:17.810 --> 01:13:19.900
Jumped off the roof?


01:13:21.980 --> 01:13:24.400
The higher you fly,
the harder you fall.


01:13:34.190 --> 01:13:36.940
Your turn or mine?
-Your turn.


01:14:23.150 --> 01:14:24.360
Hans?


01:14:25.400 --> 01:14:28.230
Leave me alone. Go away.


01:14:29.690 --> 01:14:32.520
Go away!
-Come here.


01:15:03.900 --> 01:15:05.440
What's going on?


01:15:05.730 --> 01:15:07.230
That's enough.


01:15:08.400 --> 01:15:09.770
Enough, I said.


01:15:11.690 --> 01:15:14.230
Get up.
-Fuck off!


01:15:14.690 --> 01:15:17.310
Fuck off! Fucking...


01:15:18.690 --> 01:15:19.650
Get up!


01:15:19.980 --> 01:15:21.520
Get up!


01:15:23.270 --> 01:15:24.480
Get up!


01:15:24.810 --> 01:15:26.110
Let go of me!


01:15:26.900 --> 01:15:29.360
You heartless bastards!


01:15:31.270 --> 01:15:33.150
You bastards!


01:16:41.310 --> 01:16:43.270
Mr. Giese, you testified


01:16:43.610 --> 01:16:45.730
that you were forced to partake


01:16:45.900 --> 01:16:48.980
in the deviant acts
that you were accused of.


01:16:50.190 --> 01:16:51.940
Is that correct?


01:16:52.650 --> 01:16:54.110
Yes.


01:16:55.310 --> 01:16:58.900
We now have a
written confession by Mr. Hoffmann,


01:16:59.060 --> 01:17:01.020
confirming your testimony.


01:17:03.150 --> 01:17:06.480
Your case will be submitted
to the court for appeal.


01:17:34.940 --> 01:17:36.440
Why are you doing this?


01:17:40.650 --> 01:17:42.270
It's what you wanted.


01:17:45.360 --> 01:17:46.730
No.


01:17:47.520 --> 01:17:49.060
I...


01:17:49.610 --> 01:17:50.610
Not this way.


01:17:50.940 --> 01:17:53.110
There is no other way.


01:17:59.480 --> 01:18:01.110
You don't belong here.


01:18:02.360 --> 01:18:04.110
And you do?


01:18:04.440 --> 01:18:08.400
With me it doesn't matter.
You're a teacher.


01:18:22.810 --> 01:18:26.860
So what we had is over?
-We never had anything.


01:19:47.360 --> 01:19:48.980
Ready?


01:19:49.440 --> 01:19:52.110
I've been ready for 20 years.


01:19:59.310 --> 01:20:01.650
You finally pissing off?


01:20:01.810 --> 01:20:05.690
You bet your ass.
I'll send you a postcard.


01:20:17.150 --> 01:20:19.770
So, who's up next?
-Viktor Bix.


01:20:20.110 --> 01:20:22.980
His third hearing.
Is there anything new on him?


01:20:23.150 --> 01:20:25.110
I have nothing.
-Neither do I.


01:20:40.860 --> 01:20:42.610
I gotta take a leak.
-What?


01:20:42.770 --> 01:20:44.810
I gotta take a leak real bad.


01:20:44.980 --> 01:20:47.730
You can't be serious!
-I can't help it.


01:21:41.690 --> 01:21:43.150
Bix.


01:21:49.270 --> 01:21:51.150
Bix, hurry up.


01:22:05.360 --> 01:22:07.360
Fucking idiot.


01:22:43.860 --> 01:22:46.110
What are you doing here, Hoffmann?


01:22:47.560 --> 01:22:49.060
Cozy.


01:22:50.230 --> 01:22:52.440
It's really cozy here.


01:22:55.110 --> 01:22:56.610
Like a real home.


01:22:57.860 --> 01:22:59.480
Give it back.


01:23:00.610 --> 01:23:03.440
Are you sure
you want to get out of here?


01:23:04.270 --> 01:23:06.730
Leave me alone and fuck off.


01:23:08.440 --> 01:23:10.610
I can help you, Viktor.


01:23:11.900 --> 01:23:13.690
If you want.


01:23:17.900 --> 01:23:22.360
Because you're such an expert?
-Like you in tattooing.


01:23:24.610 --> 01:23:26.650
I don't need help.


01:23:29.020 --> 01:23:30.900
Not from you.


01:24:15.860 --> 01:24:17.310
Okay.


01:24:19.020 --> 01:24:21.110
I'll see what I can do.


01:25:41.020 --> 01:25:42.940
Just like the old days.


01:25:43.610 --> 01:25:45.810
Except you're not beating me up.


01:25:55.020 --> 01:25:56.520
Wait and see.


01:26:38.560 --> 01:26:40.020
Leave me alone.


01:28:55.230 --> 01:28:57.770
What's the point anyway?


01:28:59.980 --> 01:29:04.190
Who cares
if I'm clean in here or not?


01:29:05.610 --> 01:29:07.230
I care.


01:29:08.810 --> 01:29:11.810
Maybe I'm not supposed to get out.


01:29:16.690 --> 01:29:19.810
I shot that guy dead.


01:29:19.980 --> 01:29:22.110
It happened so quick.


01:29:31.310 --> 01:29:33.360
You never asked.


01:29:35.270 --> 01:29:38.770
All these years
and you never asked once.


01:29:44.980 --> 01:29:46.480
It's funny...


01:29:48.560 --> 01:29:53.060
During the whole fucking war
I didn't kill a single soul.


01:29:56.690 --> 01:29:59.060
But when I got home, I did.


01:29:59.230 --> 01:30:01.520
Right in my own bedroom.


01:30:15.860 --> 01:30:18.730
It's an irony of fate, right?


01:30:19.480 --> 01:30:21.770
Isn't that what they call it?


01:30:21.940 --> 01:30:23.810
Irony of fate?


01:30:24.980 --> 01:30:28.560
Yes, an irony of fate.


01:30:31.730 --> 01:30:33.480
That's the phrase.


01:30:34.650 --> 01:30:36.400
And Rita...


01:30:37.440 --> 01:30:39.440
Her name was Rita.


01:30:39.610 --> 01:30:41.860
She just looked at me...


01:30:45.480 --> 01:30:47.810
... like she didn't know me.


01:30:51.150 --> 01:30:53.900
Terrified and scared,


01:30:54.060 --> 01:30:56.520
with blood splatters on her face.


01:31:00.980 --> 01:31:03.560
"What have you done?" she said.


01:31:04.060 --> 01:31:07.150
Me? What had I done,
she asked.


01:31:14.730 --> 01:31:17.270
I just wanted her to be quiet.


01:31:23.860 --> 01:31:26.060
I loved her, I really did.


01:32:20.400 --> 01:32:22.060
Give that to me.


01:32:28.400 --> 01:32:29.980
Give it back!


01:32:33.940 --> 01:32:36.150
You're such an asshole.


01:34:36.860 --> 01:34:39.480
I'm not that way.
-I know.


01:34:44.060 --> 01:34:46.230
Then leave me alone.


01:34:46.400 --> 01:34:48.730
Why are you still here?!


01:36:05.900 --> 01:36:08.770
<i>And now the first images...</i>


01:36:11.980 --> 01:36:15.810
<i>In the foreground we see</i>
<i>parts of the lunar module.</i>


01:36:18.230 --> 01:36:20.770
<i>And here, Armstrong's foot.</i>


01:36:25.310 --> 01:36:28.610
<i>Armstrong already</i>
<i>standing on the platform.</i>


01:36:29.810 --> 01:36:33.650
<i>And we hear Houston say: "Neil,</i>
<i>we see you climbing down the ladder."</i>


01:36:43.610 --> 01:36:46.270
I thought it'd be more exciting.


01:36:47.480 --> 01:36:49.440
With aliens, or what?


01:36:49.770 --> 01:36:51.480
Yeah, why not?


01:36:52.440 --> 01:36:54.560
Right, why not?


01:36:56.440 --> 01:36:59.440
You never know.
Nobody's been up there before.


01:37:42.310 --> 01:37:46.060
PARAGRAPH 175.


01:37:50.900 --> 01:37:53.650
THE LAW IS ABOLISHED


01:38:17.860 --> 01:38:18.980
What's wrong?


01:38:22.440 --> 01:38:24.400
Let's break out of here.


01:38:30.440 --> 01:38:32.150
Bust out?
-Yes.


01:38:34.020 --> 01:38:36.810
Where to?
-Anywhere.


01:38:37.150 --> 01:38:39.230
Just out of here.
-Russia...


01:38:39.400 --> 01:38:41.440
Okay. Wherever you like.


01:38:41.980 --> 01:38:45.360
And how?
-I don't know. You're the expert.


01:38:48.810 --> 01:38:51.230
You want to bust out?
You, on the run?


01:38:51.400 --> 01:38:53.150
I've been on the run all my life.


01:39:01.150 --> 01:39:04.980
I wouldn't still be rotting in here
if I could just waltz out.


01:39:06.440 --> 01:39:10.060
We're stuck in here.
That's what it's built for!


01:39:15.400 --> 01:39:17.770
Why the hell would I still be here?


01:39:18.440 --> 01:39:19.650
Tell me that!


01:39:20.440 --> 01:39:24.060
You never tried.
-Because there's no way out!


01:39:33.400 --> 01:39:35.230
What's this?


01:39:43.650 --> 01:39:45.940
Is this a joke?
Where did you get this?


01:39:49.190 --> 01:39:51.980
For real?
-I'm legal now.


01:39:53.310 --> 01:39:55.110
That's possible?


01:40:08.480 --> 01:40:12.230
I mean,
they can't just abolish a law.


01:40:13.610 --> 01:40:15.520
Can they?


01:40:35.560 --> 01:40:37.150
But...


01:40:37.900 --> 01:40:40.400
That's great.
You're going home.


01:40:41.900 --> 01:40:43.610
Yes.


01:40:45.150 --> 01:40:47.230
And I won't come back.


01:41:46.520 --> 01:41:47.980
Stop it.


01:41:57.770 --> 01:41:59.310
Stop it.


01:43:05.480 --> 01:43:07.360
You like it?


01:43:20.610 --> 01:43:23.650
Can you tell what it is?
-Sure.


01:43:37.360 --> 01:43:39.270
Come on, let's go!


01:43:42.610 --> 01:43:45.270
Don't say goodbye. It's bad luck.


01:43:52.190 --> 01:43:53.730
Hoffmann,


01:43:54.610 --> 01:43:57.060
bring me cigarettes once in a while.


01:45:07.060 --> 01:45:10.310
GREAT FREEDOM


01:45:44.360 --> 01:45:45.860
A shot.

